# #152 drills and multi-hit aerials: Blademaster's neutral air (2 hits) and Bladestorm. Blademaster a against Blademaster b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero blademaster
# Both dash in, close.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
52 a stick 0 0
# Neutral air as both jump.
100 b tap B 8
100 a tap B 8
101 a stick 0.6 0
118 a tap A 2
118 a stick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
124 a capture
133 a capture
# Bladestorm on a standing b, from just behind it.
200 a tap B 8
201 a stick 0.3 0
216 a cstick 0 -1
216 a stick 0 0
220 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
225 a capture
245 a capture
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the aerial starts, then every hit.
#! expect a 118 applied attack 1 style 12
#! expect a 216 applied attack 2 style 16
#! expect b 124 damage 3.000
#! expect b 133 damage 9.000
#! expect b 225 damage 11.000
#! expect b 230 damage 13.000
#! expect b 235 damage 15.000
#! expect b 240 damage 17.000
#! expect b 245 damage 19.000
#! scene a Tornado_Target
#! scene a CleaveDamageTarget
# View held a second, twice: the moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
